{
 "room": "S42",
 "notes": "Natural S42 WINTER (6 February 2035, owner 2026-10-06; bg_natural/S42.webp): the Hotel Grand Jasna forecourt on a clear cold day. Clouds drift over Chopok (winter sky mask), fine snow dust twinkles in the cold air, snow sifts down from the laden spruce now and then, glints on the roofs, the banks and the meadow, Nina's breath steams, alpine choughs cross the sky. The laden spruce and shrubs do not sway and the frozen fountain has no water layer. Cloud sprites: winter cumulus cut from the winter S48 / S45 skies + the shared S45 cloud_b. Winter life (art/tools/winter_ambient.py, w_* layers): the gondola runs - the painted cabins are lifted off clean plates (w_plate_*) and ride the ropes into and out of the station (clipped by the station roof and the spruce), four skiers carve down the Chopok pistes, a snowcat grooms the slope under the summit, snow blows off the hotel roof, the gable and the summit ridge, powder sifts off the station eaves, Nina and Adam breathe steam (pulsed).",
